{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_46650e3e-7f0f-9ed0-b83a-a68ae8a0f370","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"qwen3.5-122b-a10b","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Задача L-02 — написание тестов для функций review.py. Это тесты, но по правилам проекта qa-агент делает и smoke-сценарии. Здесь только unit-тесты — сделаю сам, изучив review.py сначала.\n","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":17639,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c5d79d30-f805-41b8-b1da-5977cb188b56","uuid":"e7bb7dbb-819e-40c9-b462-d011d322934e","timestamp":"2026-10-24T22:34:07.343Z","thinking_duration_ms":489,"thinking_display":"updates"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_46650e3e-7f0f-9ed0-b83a-a68ae8a0f370","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"qwen3.5-122b-a10b","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Задача **L-02. Тесты на склонение и числа в ревью PR** — это тесты, но по проекту qa-агент включает также smoke-сценарии. Сделаю сам: изучу `app/review.py`, затем напишу тесты.\n\n"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":17639,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c5d79d30-f805-41b8-b1da-5977cb188b56","uuid":"67136ec8-fd79-4230-93f4-f744a76ffa81","timestamp":"2026-10-24T22:34:07.798Z"}
